This software contains dependencies with the following open-source projects.

This version of the testbed focuses on Qwen3-VL / Qwen3.6 visual tokenizer
down-placement (terminal-side video decode + processor + ViT, uploading a
precomputed embedding bundle), dynamic token pruning (VidCom2 retention
ratio), fp8 bundle-feature quantization, and concurrent multi-user test
scenarios (barrier-aligned waves over lock-free SGLang engine sidecars).
The retired split-inference, Mage-VL and One-D-Piece links have been
removed. The third-party components listed below remain in use.

